  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{引|ひ}っ{越|こ}す (move to X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates completed action with ongoing relevance. {引|ひ}っ{越|こ}している = 'have moved' or 'am in the process of moving.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{引|ひ}っ{越|こ}す (move to X)\n- ⟦{引|ひ}っ{越|こ}し→引越し：03704_hikkoshi⟧ (moving, relocation—noun)\n- ⟦{引|ひ}っ{越|こ}し→引越し：03704_hikkoshi⟧⟦{業者|ぎょうしゃ}→業者：13130_gyousha⟧ (moving company)\n- ⟦{引|ひ}っ{越|こ}し→引越し：03704_hikkoshi⟧⟦{祝|いわ}い→祝い：01838_iwai⟧ (housewarming gift)\n- {引|ひ}っ{越|こ}して⟦{来|く}る→来る：00254_kuru⟧ (move here)\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{移|うつ}る→移る：01232_utsuru⟧:\n- {引|ひ}っ{越|こ}す: specifically moving residence\n- ⟦{移|うつ}る→移る：01232_utsuru⟧: more general 'move/transfer' (residence, job, location)\n\nCOMPOUND VERB: ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ (pull) + ⟦{越|こ}す→越す：02282_kosu⟧ (cross over) → implies moving belongings over to a new place.",
